  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Solve the following system of equations. Check to see if your solution makes each equation true.</para>
<para>\(\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;+\;y\;=\;6\\x\;+\;2y\;=\;7\end{array}\right.\)</para></section>
</content>
